<title>CANADA: Canada to hold 7 bond auctions in Q4 1996.</title>
<headline>Canada to hold 7 bond auctions in Q4 1996.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The government of Canada said it will hold seven bond auctions, including one real return issue, in the fourth quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>The first auction, of 10-year bonds, will be on September 18, with details to be released on September 12.</p>
<p>Further details follow.</p>
<p> Type	  Auction	Details	  Dated   Amt Maturing</p>
<p> 10-year     Sept 18	Sept 12	  Oct 1     3,425 million</p>
<p> 3-year	Oct 2	  Sept 26	  Oct 15     --</p>
<p> 30-year     Oct 23	 Oct 17	   Nov 1	--</p>
<p> 10-year     Nov 6	  Oct 31	   Nov 15     --</p>
<p> 5 year	Nov 20	 Nov 14	   Dec 2	--</p>
<p> real return Nov 27	 Nov 21	   Dec 6	--</p>
<p> 2-year	Dec 4	  Nov 28	   Dec 16     --</p>
<p>-- Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
